#: title/pc5_ui.c:7807
msgid "The usual way for older games like this one, with their 2D and 3D."
msgstr "Obvyklý způsob pro starší hry, jako je tato, s jejich 2D i 3D."

#: title/pc5_ui.c:7808
msgid ""
"Draws as Windows programs do, with OpenGL ready in case the game asks for "
"it. Leave it here unless the game won't start or its picture is wrong."
msgstr ""

#: title/pc5_ui.c:7809
msgid ""
"The fastest, and what most games want. Leave it here unless the game won't "
"start or its picture is wrong."
msgstr ""
"Nejrychlejší a to, co chce většina her. Nechte ho, pokud se hra spouští a "
"obraz je v pořádku."

#: title/pc5_ui.c:7811
msgid ""
"Draws as Windows programs do, without OpenGL. For a game that starts or "
"draws worse with Auto."
msgstr ""

#: title/pc5_ui.c:7813
msgid ""
"Another way to draw the game, slower than Auto. Try it if the game won't "
"start or its picture is wrong."
msgstr ""
"Jiný způsob vykreslení hry, pomalejší než Automaticky. Zkuste ho, když se "
"hra nespustí nebo má špatný obraz."

#: title/pc5_ui.c:7815
msgid ""
"Draws everything in 2D, the way ordinary Windows programs are drawn. For a "
"2D game that flickers or shows only part of its screen; a game with 3D "
"scenes won't start with it."
msgstr ""
"Vykresluje vše ve 2D, jako se vykreslují běžné programy Windows. Pro 2D "
"hru, která bliká nebo ukazuje jen část své obrazovky; hra se 3D scénami se "
"s ním nespustí."

#: title/pc5_ui.c:7817
msgid ""
"Another way to draw the game. Try it if the picture is wrong with Auto; "
"faster than Compatibility. Some mods need it."
msgstr ""
"Jiný způsob vykreslení hry. Zkuste ho, když je obraz s volbou Automaticky "
"špatně; rychlejší než Kompatibilní. Některé mody ho potřebují."

#: title/pc5_ui.c:7818
msgid ""
"The slowest, but it starts the most games. Try it if the game won't start "
"with the others."
msgstr ""
"Nejpomalejší, ale spustí nejvíc her. Zkuste ho, když se hra s ostatními "
"nespustí."

#: title/pc5_ui.c:7839
#, c-format
msgid "The game uses %s"
msgstr "Hra používá %s"

#: title/pc5_ui.c:7851
msgid "In use"
msgstr "Používá se"

#: title/pc5_ui.c:7871
msgid ""
"PC5 runs your PC games with prospero-win: Wine, DXVK for Direct3D 8 to 11, "
"VKD3D-Proton for Direct3D 12, and Mesa (RADV for Vulkan, Zink for OpenGL)."
msgstr ""
"PC5 spouští vaše PC hry pomocí prospero-win: Wine, DXVK pro Direct3D 8 až "
"11, VKD3D-Proton pro Direct3D 12 a Mesa (RADV pro Vulkan, Zink pro OpenGL)."

#: title/pc5_ui.c:7873
msgid ""
"Covers come from Steam, GOG, PCGamingWiki and Wikidata, and SteamGridDB "
"with your key. No game is part of PC5."
msgstr ""
"Obaly pocházejí ze Steamu, GOG, PCGamingWiki a Wikidata a se SteamGridDB s "
"vaším klíčem. Žádná hra není součástí PC5."

#: title/pc5_ui.c:7874
