#: title/pc5_ui.c:9062
msgid ""
"This replaces this game's pictures, music, video and media settings. Game "
"files and saves are kept."
msgstr ""
"Tím se nahradí obrázky, hudba, video a nastavení médií této hry. Soubory "
"hry a uložené hry zůstanou."

#. In a question window: the title, its text, or a button's label (keep buttons short).
