msgid "Stop updating?"
msgstr "Zastavit aktualizaci?"

#. In a question window: the title, its text, or a button's label (keep buttons short).
#: title/pc5_ui.c:9169
msgid ""
"The copy made so far is deleted and the game stays as it was. The USB "
"drive isn't changed."
msgstr ""
"Dosud vytvořená kopie se odstraní a hra zůstane jako dřív. USB disk se "
"nezmění."

#: title/pc5_ui.c:9170
msgid "Keep updating"
msgstr "Pokračovat v aktualizaci"

#. In a question window: the title, its text, or a button's label (keep buttons short).
#: title/pc5_ui.c:9172 title/pc5_ui.c:9177
msgid "Stop installing?"
msgstr "Zastavit instalaci?"

#: title/pc5_ui.c:9173
msgid ""
"What this game copied so far is deleted; games already installed stay. The "
"USB drive isn't changed. Press the back button to keep installing."
msgstr ""
"Co tato hra dosud zkopírovala, se odstraní; již nainstalované hry "
"zůstanou. USB disk se nezmění. Pro pokračování v instalaci stiskněte "
"tlačítko zpět."

#: title/pc5_ui.c:9175
msgid "Stop this game"
msgstr "Zastavit tuto hru"

#: title/pc5_ui.c:9175
msgid "Stop all"
msgstr "Zastavit vše"

#. In a question window: the title, its text, or a button's label (keep buttons short).
#: title/pc5_ui.c:9177
msgid "Everything copied so far is deleted. The USB drive isn't changed."
msgstr "Vše, co se dosud zkopírovalo, se odstraní. USB disk se nezmění."

#: title/pc5_ui.c:9178
msgid "Keep installing"
msgstr "Pokračovat v instalaci"

#: title/pc5_ui.c:9182
msgid "There are no games to uninstall"
msgstr "Nejsou žádné hry k odinstalaci"

#: title/pc5_ui.c:9190
#, c-format
msgid "Delete the saves of %s?"
msgstr "Odstranit uložené hry: %s?"

#. In a question window: the title, its text, or a button's label (keep buttons short).
#: title/pc5_ui.c:9191
msgid ""
"Its saves and settings, kept when it was uninstalled, are deleted. There "
"is no backup and no undo."
msgstr ""
"Její uložené hry a nastavení, ponechané při odinstalaci, se odstraní. "
"Neexistuje záloha a nelze to vrátit zpět."

#: title/pc5_ui.c:9200
#, c-format
msgid "Uninstall %s?"
msgstr "Odinstalovat: %s?"

#: title/pc5_ui.c:9203
msgid ""
"Keep saves: the game goes, its saves and settings stay, and installing it "
"again puts them back. Delete all: the game, its saves and settings go, "
"with no backup and no undo."
msgstr ""
"Ponechat uložené hry: hra zmizí, její uložené hry a nastavení zůstanou a "
"opětovná instalace je vrátí. Odstranit vše: hra, její uložené hry i "
"nastavení zmizí, bez zálohy a bez možnosti vrátit zpět."

#: title/pc5_ui.c:9205
msgid "Keep saves"
msgstr "Ponechat uložené hry"

#: title/pc5_ui.c:9205
msgid "Delete all"
msgstr "Odstranit vše"

#: title/pc5_ui.c:9208
msgid ""
"This deletes the game and all its saves and settings. There is no backup "
"and no undo."
msgstr ""
"Tímto se odstraní hra a všechny její uložené hry a nastavení. Neexistuje "
"záloha a nelze to vrátit zpět."

#: title/pc5_ui.c:9225
#, c-format
msgid "Settings that worked for %s"
msgstr ""

#: title/pc5_ui.c:9227
#, c-format
msgid ""
"A player got it running with PC5 %s with these settings: %s. Its other "
"settings stay as they are."
msgstr ""

#: title/pc5_ui.c:9230
#, c-format
msgid ""
"A player got it running with these settings: %s. Its other settings stay "
"as they are."
msgstr ""

